# Cherry Blossom QR — a WebGPU voxel cherry tree growing out of a QR code built from the text field (keyboard stays up); tap flattens/restores the tree for scanning, long press spawns a creeper that walks in, fuses, blows the tree apart and the tree rebuilds.
# What this test covers: the hint text, tap to flatten and back, toggling flat mid-transition, a long press creeper
# run through walk/fuse/blast/rebuild (~10 s), a second long press during the sequence (ignored), a long press
# right after the rebuild, editing the QR content (new URL rebuilds the blocks, clearing it falls back to the
# default content), and flattening with the new content.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/cherry-blossom-qrcode"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait "text" "Long press to spawn a creeper" 10000
wait 1500
# Flatten and restore.
press 201 230
wait 1500
press 201 230
wait 1500
# Toggle twice mid-transition.
press 201 230
wait 200
press 201 230
wait 1500
# Creeper: walk 3.2 s, fuse 1.8 s, blast, rebuild 1.7 s.
longpress 201 230 700
wait 2000
# A second long press while one is on its way is ignored.
longpress 201 230 700
wait 9000
# Another run right after the rebuild, with a flatten tap during the walk.
longpress 201 230 700
wait 1000
press 201 230
wait 9000
press 201 230
wait 1500
# Edit the QR content: a new URL regenerates every block.
fill 201 534 "https://reactiive.io/demos/cherry"
wait 2000
# Empty content falls back to the default QR.
fill 201 534 ""
wait 2000
fill 201 534 "hi"
wait 2000
# Flatten with the new content and back.
press 201 230
wait 1500
press 201 230
wait 1500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
